  m_PrototypeEntry: {fileID: 114418146592902190}
  m_Levels:
  - displayName: "\u0421hase"
    loadName: lvl_1
    description: The reconnaissance team intercepted information that a column carrying
      unknown weaponry is en route to one of Alkuda's camps. Our task is to intercept
      the column and identify the transported armaments
    screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2ee44a7b98c2445418336f89c5ff1c14, type: 3}
  - displayName: Search
    loadName: lvl_2
    description: Thanks to the information obtained from the last mission, we managed
      to track the whereabouts of the Alkuda leader. It's time to deal with him.
    screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 76c2f8a9687ff304c984667e4a460da9, type: 3}
  - displayName: Rat hole
    loadName: lvl_3
    description: You can't hide forever. All the trails lead to one place. A remote
      camp among the mountains, the last refuge of the Alkuda leader. There's nowhere
      left to run.
    screenshot: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 96fc6bdfd3c9bec439a280aa5975b9e8, type: 3}
